            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abanye abantu, abapristi, namaLevi, nabalindisango, nabahlabeleli, namaNethini, nabo bonke abazahlukanisa nabantu bamazwe ngokomthetho kaNkulunkulu, nawomkabo, namadodana abo, namadodakazi abo, yilowo nalowo onolwazi nokuqondisisa;",
