          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi sazenzela iziqondiso zokuthi sikhokhe ingxenye yesithathu yeshekeli minyaka yonke enkonzweni yendlu kaNkulunkulu wethu;",
          "type": "text",
