              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Senza inkatho phakathi kwabapristi namaLevi nabantu ngeminikelo yokhuni ukuba bayingenise endlini kaNkulunkulu wethu njengezindlu zawobaba ngezikhathi ezimisiweyo iminyaka ngeminyaka, ukushisa i-altare kaJehova uNkulunkulu wethu, njengokulotshiweyo emthethweni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.34"
            ]
          }
        }
