        {
          "text": "Futhi kumelwe silethe ulibo lwenhlama yethu neminikelo yethu nezithelo zazo zonke izinhlobo zemithi, iwayini namafutha kubapristi emakamelweni endlu kaNkulunkulu wethu; nokweshumi kwezwe lethu kumaLevi, ukuze wona amaLevi athole okweshumi emizini yonke esilinywayo.",
