          "text": "Ngokuba abantwana bakwa-Israyeli nabantwana bakwaLevi bayakuletha umnikelo kakolweni, owewayini, nowamafutha emakamelweni, lapho izitsha zendlu engcwele, nabapristi abakhonzayo, nabalindisango, nabahlabeleli, futhi ngeke siyishiye indlu kaNkulunkulu wethu.",
